---
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro';
import Finding from '../components/Finding.astro';
---
<StarlightPage frontmatter={{
    title: 'CLI to lint and enforce rules for LLM generated codebases',
    description: 'CLI to lint and enforce rules for LLM generated codebases',
    template: 'splash',
    editUrl: false,
    lastUpdated: false,
}}>
    <div class="landing">
        <nav class="actions" aria-label="Start using gspot">
            <a href="/guides/install/">Get started</a>
            <a href="/reference/commands/check/">Command reference</a>
        </nav>
        <p>Setup currently requires a source checkout and Bun 1.3.11.
            The installation guide covers prerequisites and the commands to run from that checkout.</p>
        <p>Choose presets in <code>gspot.toml</code> to configure tools and checks.
            Generated rule guides give coding agents instructions for your repository.</p>
        <section aria-labelledby="finding">
            <h2 id="finding">Find and correct a Bash syntax error</h2>
            <Finding />
        </section>
        <section aria-labelledby="setup">
            <h2 id="setup">Configure your repository</h2>
            <p>Run <code>gspot init</code> from your repository root. Review the proposed presets,
                file changes, and integrations before accepting. Run <code>gspot check</code> separately.</p>
            <p>For existing configuration and recovery options, follow the{' '}<a href="/guides/existing-repository/">existing repository guide</a>.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="/guides/customize/">Choose checks and exceptions</a></li>
                <li><a href="/guides/hooks-and-ci/">Run checks in hooks and CI</a></li>
                <li><a href="/guides/agents/">Configure coding-agent instructions</a></li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </div>
</StarlightPage>
<style>
    .landing { max-width: 1120px; }
    .landing > p, section > p { max-width: 68ch; }
    .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px 32px; margin-block: 0 24px; }
    .actions a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; font-weight: 600; }
    .actions a { border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 20px; text-decoration: none; }
    .actions a:first-child { background: var(--sl-color-white); color: var(--sl-color-black); }
    .actions a:hover { border-color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); }
    section { margin-top: 64px; padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); }
    .landing > section > h2 { margin: 0 0 24px; padding: 0; border: 0; }
</style>
